                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A high-explosive bomb used for the purposes of demolishing extensive areas, such as a city block."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d2a8828-f92d-32b0-a9db-0c729c0854f8",
                                        "entry_id": "0ad03d6e-f450-3004-b69b-67d0ca132500",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something, such as a film or book, that sustains exceptional and widespread popularity and achieves enormous sales, as opposed to a box office bomb."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a32c31f8-0d1a-4c35-b736-7ea5385eb81d",
                                                "sense_id": "1d2a8828-f92d-32b0-a9db-0c729c0854f8",
                                                "text": "He was watching the blockbuster film series Harry Potter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7f39b71-a50f-37d1-b42d-87b5373c9aac",
                                        "entry_id": "0ad03d6e-f450-3004-b69b-67d0ca132500",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something, especially an event or a film, book or other creative work, that is intended to achieve high sales (perhaps indicated by large budgets or high advertising spending) or that is conceived on a large or epic scale"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7d028b6-2974-4a7f-ad83-18c5cfde2c0b",
                                                "sense_id": "d7f39b71-a50f-37d1-b42d-87b5373c9aac",
                                                "text": "\"General William Booth Enters into Heaven\" is lusty, a blockbuster conception."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b35b8abc-6a82-46c7-9be4-9759ee0d70f3",
                                                "sense_id": "d7f39b71-a50f-37d1-b42d-87b5373c9aac",
                                                "text": "The report noted that 'an increasing public appetite for large \"blockbuster\" musicals is a firmly established feature of London’s West End theatre scene'."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4abd8456-286c-3340-8d5a-6bf640db301c",
                                        "entry_id": "0ad03d6e-f450-3004-b69b-67d0ca132500",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything very large or powerful; a whopper."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ed67282-1c15-4e9a-bc77-19421eb99872",
                                                "sense_id": "4abd8456-286c-3340-8d5a-6bf640db301c",
                                                "text": "“How nice,\" she responded to his invitation, “but I've got a blockbuster of a headache. I'm paying for last night. Call me tomorrow, will you?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75e5e8d9-5214-464e-a649-01cdd81504eb",
                                                "sense_id": "4abd8456-286c-3340-8d5a-6bf640db301c",
                                                "text": "Many—such as plants' relationships with mycorrhizal fungi—have been blockbuster moments in the history of life, with world-changing consequences."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44264ebe-7677-4f58-9841-e0bf0bdd51ce",
                                                "sense_id": "4abd8456-286c-3340-8d5a-6bf640db301c",
                                                "text": "In the mid-2021 economy, employers are offering higher pay to attract scarce workers; airports and car lots are bustling; and a G.D.P. report due out next week will probably show blockbuster growth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc0923f2-f093-41ae-bc94-db380b95e064",
                                                "sense_id": "4abd8456-286c-3340-8d5a-6bf640db301c",
                                                "text": "The trove of documents from half a dozen federal agencies in recent days are a direct result of a blockbuster Supreme Court decision last month that allowed the administration to develop plans for ending birthright citizenship – even though the effort has once again been placed on hold."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ec89230-d167-309e-9818-1632f67ee66d",
                                        "entry_id": "0ad03d6e-f450-3004-b69b-67d0ca132500",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large firework of the firecracker type; an M-80."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e34052d4-e16f-3940-8e8d-07b4273ccc43",
                                        "entry_id": "0ad03d6e-f450-3004-b69b-67d0ca132500",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who engages in blockbusting (technique encouraging people to sell property)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4af0c661-45a6-40db-98a1-abb012f72818",
                                                "sense_id": "e34052d4-e16f-3940-8e8d-07b4273ccc43",
                                                "text": "Whereas White residents fell prey to blockbusters who stoked fears of invading Negroes and plummeting housing values during the 1950s, African Americans confronted more-than-imagined difficulties in neighborhoods after the 1968 riots."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
